# {Documented Supabase and deployment environment variables for Netlify and local preview} [Commented by: Sonic on 10/12/2026 10:45 AM]

# VITE_SUPABASE_URL: Your Supabase Project URL (e.g. https://your-project.supabase.co)
# In Supabase: Project Settings -> API -> Project URL
# In Netlify: Automatically injected if using Netlify's official Supabase integration extension.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL="https://xyzcompany.supabase.co"

# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY: Your Supabase Anon/Public Key (e.g. eyJhbGciOi...)
# In Supabase: Project Settings -> API -> Project API Keys -> anon / public
# In Netlify: Automatically injected if using Netlify's official Supabase integration extension.
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY="eyJhbGciOi..."

# Optional global fallback keys (users configure their own in Sign Up / Settings)
VITE_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=""
VITE_TAVILY_API_KEY=""
